{"text": "Jour 4 : l'\u00e9cole de Petitbourg ! Le vote est tomb\u00e9. Merci d'\u00eatre aussi nombreux, Petitbourg grandit chaque jour. Vous avez vot\u00e9 l'\u00e9cole, et elle sort de terre ! Deux mille euros pour apprendre \u00e0 tous les habitants. Chaque classe sera pleine d'habitants motiv\u00e9s. Mais la caisse est presque vide : cent euros seulement. Heureusement, des m\u00e9c\u00e8nes ont r\u00e9pondu \u00e0 l'appel ! Chaque euro compte pour construire la ville de vos r\u00eaves. Cent euros, plus cinq mille cinq cents de dons : cinq mille six cents euros. Moins deux mille pour l'\u00e9cole : il reste trois mille six cents euros. Partie 2 : l'\u00e9quipe du FC Petitbourg !", "timing": [41.822041, [0.0, 0.116, 0.174, 0.197, 0.232, 0.29, 0.464, 0.639, 0.697, 1.08, 1.126, 1.161, 1.207, 1.265, 1.347, 1.382, 1.416, 1.44, 1.474, 1.509, 1.567, 1.602, 1.695, 1.753, 1.811, 1.846, 1.904, 1.985, 2.043, 2.101, 2.148, 2.206, 2.334, 2.844, 2.914, 2.961, 3.007, 3.042, 3.135, 3.193, 3.216, 3.239, 3.262, 3.286, 3.309, 3.355, 3.39, 3.471, 3.529, 3.587, 3.738, 3.866, 4.563, 4.621, 4.679, 4.725, 4.783, 4.83, 4.876, 4.899, 4.923, 4.957, 5.004, 5.05, 5.074, 5.097, 5.12, 5.166, 5.201, 5.259, 5.306, 5.364, 5.387, 5.445, 5.492, 5.538, 5.596, 5.631, 5.666, 5.735, 5.828, 6.037, 6.095, 6.188, 6.246, 6.293, 6.327, 6.374, 6.42, 6.455, 6.502, 6.525, 6.56, 6.606, 6.664, 6.699, 6.734, 6.815, 6.885, 6.908, 6.943, 6.978, 7.024, 7.094, 7.129, 7.152, 7.175, 7.21, 7.245, 7.326, 7.372, 7.523, 7.639, 8.081, 8.139, 8.173, 8.197, 8.22, 8.278, 8.324, 8.359, 8.406, 8.429, 8.464, 8.499, 8.58, 8.649, 8.696, 8.742, 8.766, 8.8, 8.835, 8.916, 9.044, 9.102, 9.218, 9.253, 9.462, 9.578, 9.613, 9.636, 9.683, 9.706, 9.729, 9.752, 9.799, 9.834, 9.903, 9.927, 9.961, 9.985, 10.008, 10.054, 10.101, 10.147, 10.263, 10.31, 10.356, 10.379, 10.437, 10.519, 11.215, 11.296, 11.355, 11.378, 11.401, 11.436, 11.459, 11.517, 11.552, 11.575, 11.598, 11.622, 11.645, 11.668, 11.749, 11.819, 11.854, 11.877, 11.912, 11.958, 11.